amayamay dimay silew ed kuartod tagey a nantitiponan mi
nadngel ya na saray totoon wadm an tan kuanda kinmarul inkuan balet na saray arum akisalitay sakey ya anghil ed sikato
salanti say katwaan a niamut nen i nmona ran panaon tan diad amin a katoowan balet nipaamta la natan ed saray totooy dios
