saray akaonan akadngel na maung a balita et ag ira akapampainawa lapud ag ira anisia balet wala ray makapampainawa
maerermen lamet si jesus tan linmad lobuk ya inyongib a walay akasaran bato
natan amta tayo ya amin iray wala d ganggan et para saray walad silong na ganggan pian napatonda toy pambabaraan na amin a katoowan tan napasilong tod panagsintinsia na dios so sankamundoan
