nampapara kamin kumikimey na dios tan sikayoy alog to sikayo met s o paalagey na dios
inmingal tan singa ungol na lion so ingal to kaingal to inmebat a dinmalagorug so pitoran karul
kanyan mampatauli ka ta no andi onla ak ditan a tampol tan labanan ko ra yan totoo diad panamegley na ispadan ompapaway ed sangik
