inabuloyan to ra kanyan pinmaway ira may ispiritun maoges ed samay laki tan linmoob irad saramay baboy amin da ra may baboy sakey a duan liboy bilang dabinmatik irad pandel naplag irad dayat tan nalner ira
balet antoy kuan tayo no say panggagawa tayoy kaogsan so lalon mangipatnag a matonung so gagawaey dios ibaga ti kasin m akapoy so gagawaey dios no dusaen to itayo
insan to inaampupo ra may ogogaw intatapew to ray lima tod sikara tan binibindisionan to ra
purpura tan ambalbalanga so kawes to may bii balituk mabmabli ran bato tan pirlas iray alahas to sankabembenan toy balituk a kupa a napnoy marorotak tan mabambanday iran bengatla a sikaray bunga na panagkasalanan toy inmoralidad
wala siriy tinandaan dan agew ya ipawil da kasabi to man ya agew amayamay iray dinmadagod panaayaman nen pablo manlapud kabwasan ya anggad labi impaliwawa tan pinaneknekan tod sikaray nipaakar ed panariay dios diad panamegley na ganggan nen moises tan saray insusulat da ray propita ginawa toy anggaay nayarian to a panisiaen irad kinen jesus
tandaan yo ya napirdonay amin a kasalanan na too tan amin a maoges a lalabiren to
no kasumpal tin naamtaay katwaan et gagalaen tayo niy mankasalanan anggapo lay bagat a makapaandid saray kasalanan tayo
kanyan ag kayo natatakot ta mabli kayo ni nen saray amayamay ya anuyaw
kagalgalang kon teofilo amayamay la ray nanoksuy tan nansulat na nipaakar ed saray bengatlan agawgawad pegley mi
anto ra tan a ganggan tepet to inmebat si jesus ag ka mamapatey ag ka mikakaloguran ag ka mantatakew ag ka mantitila ed pantasim
insan onsabiy kasamputan kasumpal a taloen nen cristo iray amin a maispiritun manoley saray walay betang tan pakayari tan yawat tod dios ama so panarian
