impatombuk to ni say mandotak ed too say ompaway a manlapud sikato
no bilang ta ag to nayarian mangibakiy totoo ton miariglo ed samay arin kalaban to ambegyan arawi ni
kasumpal to ya linmetaw ed tawen so makapakelkelaw a sinyal sakey a biin say agew so kawes to say bulan so tinoonan da ra y sali to tan nankoronay labinduan bitewen so olo to
