kanyan nen amin san a nantitipon ira tinepet dad kinen jesus katawan ipawil mo la kasi natan ed israel so panarian
kinmulang so alak kanyan imbagay ina nen jesus ed sikato naoputan iray alak
si aram so ama nen aminadab si aminadab so ama nen naason si naason so ama nen salmon
anengneng na amin a manaayam ed lida tan saron si eneas kanyan anisia rad katawan
kanyan agagi diad pegley na segsegang tan kairapan mi aligliwa kami diad impakadngel miy pananisia yod cristo
si moises matoor a managlingkur ed abung na dios balet pinaneknekan to labat iray bengatlan ibagay dios ed arapen
natan diad iyolid bilay na saray inaatey siopay makanasawa ed samay bii et anta amin da ra may pitoran sanaagi et nambabalesan dan inasawa
maliket so toon mansiansian matoor anggaman a wala ray subsubok ya onsabid sikato ta no nilabas to ra awaten toy tuman g salanti say bilay ya insipay dios ed saray mangaarod sikato
