antakot ak ed sika kanyan inyamut kod dalin imay kuartam nia la may sanliboy pisos yo
say dios pinaoli tod bilay so katawan ontan met a paolien to itayo diad panamegley na pakayari to
dinmalan ira di pablo tan silas ed amfipolis tan apolonia tan sinmabi rad tesalonica walad may sinagoga da ray judio
inmebat ira inyabuloy nen moises a say laki nayarian ton isian so asawa to kasumpal ton itday kasulatan na pansiyan
kanyan sikayo tan say sanidrin kerew yod kapitan ya ibaki tod sikayo si pablo ibaraan yo a labay yo nin tepetan a maung na nipaakar ed sikaton dili balet sipaparaan kamin mamatey ed sikato kasakbayan a makasabi dia
ta say imbakiy dios ipulong toy salitay dios ta ag nasabsabaay pangiter na dios ed sikato na ispiritu
